vceLinkTable            OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX              SEQUENCE OF VceLinkEntry
    MAX-ACCESS          not-accessible
    STATUS              current
    DESCRIPTION         "A list of link entries. The number of entries
                        is given by the value of vceLinkNum."
::= { vceLinkObject 2 }

